{
  "info": {
    "name": "Social Media Intelligence API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for User Management endpoints",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "User Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (responseData.data && responseData.data.id) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"userId\", responseData.data.id);",
                  "        console.log(\"User ID saved:\", responseData.data.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n    \"fullName\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user with email, password, and full name.\n\n**Password Requirements:**\n- Minimum 8 characters\n- At least one uppercase letter\n- At least one lowercase letter\n- At least one digit\n- At least one special character\n\n**Email Requirements:**\n- Valid email format (RFC 5322)\n- Maximum 255 characters\n\n**Full Name Requirements:**\n- 2-255 characters"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve user details by their UUID.\n\nReturns user information including:\n- User ID\n- Email\n- Full Name\n- Created At timestamp\n- Updated At timestamp"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/by-email?email=john.doe@example.com",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "by-email"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "john.doe@example.com",
                  "description": "Email address to search for"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Find a user by their email address.\n\nEmail is normalized and validated before lookup."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve a list of all registered users.\n\nReturns an array of user objects."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"john.updated@example.com\",\n    \"fullName\": \"John Updated Doe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update user profile information (email and full name).\n\n**Note:** Password cannot be changed via this endpoint. Use the Change Password endpoint instead.\n\n**Validation:**\n- Email must be unique (cannot use email of another user)\n- Same validation rules as registration apply"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"currentPassword\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n    \"newPassword\": \"NewSecurePass456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/change-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}",
                "change-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Change user password.\n\n**Requirements:**\n- Must provide correct current password\n- New password must meet strength requirements (8+ chars, uppercase, lowercase, digit, special char)\n\n**Errors:**\n- Returns 400 if current password is incorrect\n- Returns 400 if new password doesn't meet requirements"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Delete a user account.\n\n**Cascade Behavior:**\n- Automatically deletes associated user credentials\n- Permanently removes user data\n\n**Note:** This operation cannot be undone."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Complete set of User Management API endpoints.\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:8080 (configurable via environment variable)\n\n**API Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"message\": \"Operation successful\",\n    \"data\": { ... },\n    \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-31T12:00:00\"\n}\n```\n\n**Error Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"message\": \"Error description\",\n    \"data\": null,\n    \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-31T12:00:00\"\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
